    <sys:String x:Key="Msg_Content_MinuteRange" xml:space="preserve">(Line {0}) : {1}

The minute must be between 0 and 59.</sys:String>

    <sys:String x:Key="Msg_Content_SecondRange" xml:space="preserve">(Line {0}) : {1}

